---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /bingo/
title: Djurbingo
description: >-
  Djurbingo på Stättareds 4H-gård: en slumpad bricka med djur att hitta på gården, och
  konfetti när brickan är full.
---
{#-
  The bingo page (02-§12, ADR 0009, ADR 0024). Markup only: the board is drawn by
  source/ts/ui/bingo.ts from the candidates the build lists in the pool below, one
  <template> per species or animal with the same responsive picture as the rest of the
  site. The templates are inert until the script clones one into a square, so a hundred
  animals cost the page nothing to load. Without script the page says so (02-§12.13).

  The start screen and the game are two sections; the script shows one of them. The
  dialog is a native <dialog>, like the feedback dialog (05-§6.35): the square's
  picture larger, its name, and one button that marks or unmarks it (02-§12.7).
#}
<div class="container container--narrow bingo" data-bingo>
  <h1>Djurbingo</h1>

  {%- if views.bingo.species.length > 0 %}
  <form class="bingo-start" data-bingo-start>
    <p class="lead">Du får en bricka med djur. Hitta dem på gården och bocka av dem. Full bricka är bingo!</p>
    <fieldset class="field field--choices">
      <legend class="field__label">Hur stor bricka?</legend>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="size" value="3" checked> 3 × 3</label>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="size" value="4"> 4 × 4</label>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset class="field field--choices">
      <legend class="field__label">Vad ska du hitta?</legend>
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="level" value="species" checked> Ett djurslag, till exempel en get</label>
      {%- if views.bingo.animals.length > 0 %}
      <label class="choice"><input class="choice__input" type="radio" name="level" value="animal"> Just det djuret på bilden</label>
      {%- endif %}
    </fieldset>
    <p><button class="button" type="submit">Börja spela</button></p>
    <noscript><p class="note">Djurbingo behöver JavaScript. Slå på det i webbläsaren och ladda om sidan.</p></noscript>
  </form>

  <section class="bingo-game" data-bingo-game hidden>
    <p class="bingo-progress" data-bingo-progress aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div class="bingo-board" data-bingo-board role="group" aria-label="Bingobrickan"></div>
    <div class="bingo-win note" data-bingo-win hidden aria-live="assertive">
      <h2 class="bingo-win__title">Bingo!</h2>
      <p>Du hittade alla djuren på brickan.</p>
      <p><button class="button" type="button" data-bingo-again>Spela igen</button></p>
    </div>
    <p class="bingo-restart"><button class="button button--secondary" type="button" data-bingo-new>Ny bricka</button></p>
  </section>

  <div hidden data-bingo-pool>
    {%- for candidate in views.bingo.species %}
    <template data-level="species" data-key="{{ candidate.key }}" data-name="{{ candidate.name }}">{% picture candidate.photo, "(min-width: 680px) 160px, 25vw", false, candidate.name %}</template>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- for candidate in views.bingo.animals %}
    <template data-level="animal" data-key="{{ candidate.key }}" data-name="{{ candidate.name }}">{% picture candidate.photo, "(min-width: 680px) 160px, 25vw", false, candidate.name %}</template>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <dialog class="dialog" data-bingo-dialog aria-labelledby="bingo-dialog-heading">
    <div class="dialog__body">
      <div class="dialog__header">
        <h2 class="dialog__title" id="bingo-dialog-heading" data-bingo-dialog-title>Djuret</h2>
        <button class="icon-button dialog__close" type="button" aria-label="Stäng" data-bingo-dialog-close>
          <svg class="icon-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22">
            <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="bingo-dialog__image" data-bingo-dialog-image></div>
      <p data-bingo-dialog-text></p>
      <div class="dialog__actions">
        <button class="button" type="button" data-bingo-dialog-toggle>Hittat!</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  {%- else %}
  <div class="note">
    <h2>Djuren är inte inlagda ännu</h2>
    <p>
      När djuren finns på sajten kan du spela bingo med dem här. Under tiden hittar du allt
      om gården på <a href="{{ site.mainSite }}">4h.se/stattared</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</div>
